诸葛邓钟传第二十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0062.xhtml","index":404,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":44,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wgc-q0125","section":"chapter-028","block":"b-6042821b45101ef15ac7","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝一﹞《世语》曰：“咸宁中，积射将军樊震为西戎牙门，得见辞，武帝问震所由进；震自陈，曾为邓艾伐蜀时帐下将。帝遂寻问艾，震具申艾之忠，言之流涕。先是以艾孙朗为丹水令，由此迁为定陵令。次孙千秋有时望，光禄大夫王戎辟为掾。永嘉中，朗为新都太守，未之官；在襄阳失火，朗及母、妻、子举室烧死，惟子韬、子行得免。千秋先卒，二子亦烧死。”","attribution":"世语","section_title":"王毌丘诸葛邓钟传第二十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0062.xhtml","index":434,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-eb8e172102a1d53631b6","start":0,"end":162,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wgc-q0409","section":"chapter-028","block":"b-3eee78df7e835abac8d7","layer":"original","quote":"诏曰：“艾有功勋，受罪不逃刑；而子孙为民隶，朕常愍之。其以嫡孙朗为郎中","section_title":"王毌丘诸葛邓钟传第二十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0062.xhtml","index":404,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":7,"end":42,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wgc-q0410","section":"chapter-028","block":"b-3fcbf92c542704760e86","layer":"modern","quote":"〖22〗九年：泰始九年（公元 273）。","section_title":"王毌丘诸葛邓钟传第二十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0062.xhtml","index":429,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-ed84f38f20373a790ae1","start":0,"end":20,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wgc-q0608","section":"chapter-028","block":"b-6042821b45101ef15ac7","layer":"pei","quote":"先是以艾孙朗为丹水令，由此迁为定陵令","attribution":"裴注·世语","section_title":"王毌丘诸葛邓钟传第二十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0062.xhtml","index":434,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-eb8e172102a1d53631b6","start":71,"end":89,